          </span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span
            style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(98, 96, 122); text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;"
          >
            Source URLs
          </span>
          <div
            style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"
